t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。绝大多数游戏把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设得远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——玩家的准星指向是最强的意图信号，「我正对着谁」几乎总应压过「谁离我更近」。下表对比三种权重取向落在玩家手感上的差别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权重取向</th>\n<th>主导因子</th>\n<th>玩家感受</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>角度优先（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极大）</td>\n<td>准星指向</td>\n<td>贴我正对着的，符合直觉</td>\n<td>竞技 FPS 主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离优先（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大）</td>\n<td>世界距离</td>\n<td>总贴最近的，近身乱战顺手</td>\n<td>快节奏近战</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性硬门（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为硬约束）</td>\n<td>是否被挡</td>\n<td>绝不贴掩体后的人</td>\n<td>强掩体对枪游戏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[场景全部实体] --&gt; B[廉价过滤&lt;br/&gt;阵营 存活 视锥 距离]&#10;    B --&gt; C{通过?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| X[剔除]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[角度门限 theta 小于 theta_out]&#10;    D --&gt; E[遮挡射线检测&lt;br/&gt;最贵 放最后]&#10;    E --&gt; F[候选集]&#10;    F --&gt; G[加权打分&lt;br/&gt;角度权重远大于距离]&#10;    G --&gt; H[取最高分为当前目标]&#10;    H --&gt; I[送入减速区/磁吸/子弹修正]\">flowchart TD\n    A[场景全部实体] --&gt; B[廉价过滤&lt;br/&gt;阵营 存活 视锥 距离]\n    B --&gt; C{通过?}\n    C --&gt;|否| X[剔除]\n    C --&gt;|是| D[角度门限 theta 小于 theta_out]\n    D --&gt; E[遮挡射线检测&lt;br/&gt;最贵 放最后]\n    E --&gt; F[候选集]\n    F --&gt; G[加权打分&lt;br/&gt;角度权重远大于距离]\n    G --&gt; H[取最高分为当前目标]\n    H --&gt; I[送入减速区/磁吸/子弹修正]</pre><h2 id=\"目标切换与迟滞-别在两个人之间抖\">目标切换与迟滞：别在两个人之间抖</h2><p>打分函数每帧独立算一次，会带来一个恼人的问题：当两个敌人分数接近时，微小的准星抖动就能让「当前目标」在两人之间来回跳，辅助随之左右拉扯准星，产生 <a href=\"../foundations/perceptibility\">可察觉性与手感</a> 里点名的「抢目标」失败模式。解决办法是引入迟滞（hysteresis）——给「当前正贴着的目标」一份留任加成，让它比挑战者高出一个阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 才允许被替换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>切换当且仅当</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{切换当且仅当}\\quad \\text{score}(t_{new}) &gt; \\text{score}(t_{cur}) + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">切换当且仅当</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，目标越「黏」，切换越迟钝，但也越不会误跳；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 太大则玩家想主动换枪口对准新目标时会感到「甩不掉旧目标」。这与减速区的黏滞感是同一类张力，只是发生在「选谁」而非「转多少」的层面。除了自动切换，很多游戏还提供玩家主动切换的入口：锁定自瞄形态下按摇杆方向在身体部位间切换（TLOU2 的头/躯干/腿），这属于把选择权交还玩家的可达性设计，完整讨论在 <a href=\"../practice/accessibility-aim\">可达性瞄准</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与战斗系统锁定的边界\">与战斗系统锁定的边界</h2><p>目标获取很容易与另一套听起来相似的系统混淆：战斗玩法里的「目标锁定」（lock-on / target lock，如动作游戏按键锁定 Boss、镜头持续对准）。二者必须分清。瞄准辅助的目标获取是<strong>逐帧、隐式、可被玩家意图覆盖</strong>的：它每帧重选，玩家把准星移开就自然切走，玩家甚至不知道它存在。战斗系统的目标锁定是<strong>显式、有状态、玩家主动触发</strong>的玩法机制：按键锁定后镜头与攻击语义都围绕锁定目标改变，直到玩家再次按键解除。前者是补偿的指向器，后者是玩法规则；前者的「贴谁」服务于让手动瞄准更准，后者的「锁谁」本身就是玩法。二者的分工在 <a href=\"../../game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/targeting-lock-on\">战斗系统 · 目标锁定</a> 有对应的另一侧视角。把这条边界记牢：本篇讲的目标获取永远服务于「让玩家自己的枪更准」，一旦它变成「玩家不瞄也自动锁死」，就跨进了锁定自瞄乃至自瞄外挂的领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>目标获取是前两层与第三层辅助的前置模块：它不移动准星、不弯折子弹，只决定补偿指向谁。</li>\n<li>流程分两步——先用廉价布尔过滤（阵营/存活/视锥/距离/角度）筛出候选集，最贵的遮挡射线检测放最后；再用加权打分选一个，角度权重通常远大于距离。</li>\n<li>迟滞（留任加成阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>）防止目标在分数接近的两人之间抖动，代价是可能「甩不掉旧目标」。</li>\n<li>隐式逐帧的目标获取与战斗系统显式有状态的目标锁定是两回事，前者服务手动瞄准、后者是玩法规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>选定目标后如何被贴住/跟随：<a href=\"magnetism-friction\">磁吸与减速区</a></li>\n<li>选定目标后开火如何被修正：<a href=\"bullet-magnetism\">子弹修正</a></li>\n<li>把选择权交还玩家的部位切换：<a href=\"../practice/accessibility-aim\">可达性瞄准</a></li>\n<li>玩法层的显式目标锁定（另一侧视角）：<a href=\"../../game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/targeting-lock-on\">战斗系统 · 目标锁定</a></li>\n<li>遮挡查询依赖的命中体系统：<a href=\"../../game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">战斗系统 · hitbox/hurtbox</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"目标获取","id":"目标获取"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"候选集：谁有资格被辅助","id":"候选集-谁有资格被辅助"},{"level":2,"text":"打分：从候选集里选一个","id":"打分-从候选集里选一个"},{"level":2,"text":"目标切换与迟滞：别在两个人之间抖","id":"目标切换与迟滞-别在两个人之间抖"},{"level":2,"text":"与战斗系统锁定的边界","id":"与战斗系统锁定的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"磁吸与减速区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/techniques/magnetism-friction"},"next":{"title":"子弹修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-aim-assist-systems/techniques/bullet-magnetism"}}